{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 3, :comments ["<b>Behold</b> — Even if a man lies with many women countless times, the woman will not conceive except at the time that HaShem has decreed, for in His hand are the keys to every womb, and the gift of sons is an inheritance; He gives it to whom He wills." "<b>Reward</b> — The meaning is the reward of the deed, and it is the fruit of the womb."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 127, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:41:20.830917187Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}